/gpb

# Live Google session captures: cookies, tokens and signed media URLs recorded
# from a real account. spike/.gitignore also excludes these; the rule is repeated
# here so moving or losing that file cannot make them committable.
captures/

# Media pulled down while probing, wherever it lands.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.heic
*.mp4
*.mov

# Issue tracker and agent tooling. The issues live in a Dolt database under
# .beads/ and stay on the machine that works on this; the rest is hook wiring for
# whatever assistant happens to be driving. None of it is part of what runs, and
# none of it is any use to someone who has cloned this.
.beads/
.agents/
.claude/
.codex/
.dolt/
.beads-credential-key

*.db
